// BRANCH checked by the runner, a program agent: Red when its head does not contain COMMIT, else what the check at
// the head says (no branch: the repository's checked-out one). The verdict comes back as its answer.
/// a branch checked by the runner: Red when its head does not contain the commit, else the check's verdict
kind check
  letter K
  form commit: Ref, branch: Ref?
  result Green | Red(log: Text)
  pattern
    step runner check(commit, branch)
